[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Software Design Description
PREFIX: LLR-

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Verifier Component Design

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-VER-001
TITLE: ExecutionLogVerifier Struct
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement ExecutionLogVerifier in testcase-verification crate with methods for
loading, parsing, and comparing execution logs against test cases.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-VER-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-VER-002
TITLE: Pattern Matching Engine
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement output matching strategies in testcase-verification: exact match, regex
compilation and matching, JSON schema validation.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-VER-002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-VER-003
TITLE: Exit Code Comparator
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement exit code verification comparing actual vs expected with support for
numeric comparison and optional range/set matching.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-VER-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-VER-004
TITLE: Mismatch Detail Generator
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement mismatch reporting showing line-by-line diffs and character-level
highlighting of actual vs expected output.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-VER-004

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-VER-005
TITLE: Verifier Orchestrator
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement orchestration in testcase-orchestration crate processing multiple
execution logs and aggregating results.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-VER-005

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Test Case Content Design

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-TC-001
TITLE: TestCase Model Structure
STATEMENT: >>>
Define TestCase struct in testcase-models with fields: test_case_id, title,
description, sequences, prerequisites, environment_variables, hooks.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-TC-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-TC-002
TITLE: TestSequence Model
STATEMENT: >>>
Define TestSequence struct containing sequence_id, name, steps list, and
variable scope management.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-TC-002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-TC-003
TITLE: TestStep Model
STATEMENT: >>>
Define TestStep struct with description, command, expected_exit_code,
expected_output, captured_variables fields.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-TC-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-TC-004
TITLE: Variable Capture Handler
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement variable capture in testcase-execution with regex extraction and
command substitution.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-TC-004

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-TC-005
TITLE: Expected Output Specification
